\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Training-loss curves for all six single-objective configurations and the combination over 300 epochs on 8$\times $A100 GPUs. The three topology-aware losses (Dice+CE, +clDice, +Skeleton Recall) and the three reconstruction-aware losses (+SSIM, +MSE-DT, +Perceptual) converge to similar final training loss; +MSE-DT trains at the highest absolute loss throughout because the MSE-on-distance-transform term has a different scale than the Dice and CE components. All seven runs are stable under cosine annealing with 10-epoch warmup; no NaN batches occurred over $\sim $5.7M training samples.}}{5}{figure.caption.7}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:learning_curves_extended}{{3}{5}{Training-loss curves for all six single-objective configurations and the combination over 300 epochs on 8$\times $A100 GPUs. The three topology-aware losses (Dice+CE, +clDice, +Skeleton Recall) and the three reconstruction-aware losses (+SSIM, +MSE-DT, +Perceptual) converge to similar final training loss; +MSE-DT trains at the highest absolute loss throughout because the MSE-on-distance-transform term has a different scale than the Dice and CE components. All seven runs are stable under cosine annealing with 10-epoch warmup; no NaN batches occurred over $\sim $5.7M training samples}{figure.caption.7}{}}
